+        /* Exhausting conservative advancement is not a separation proof.
+         * Long tangential motion can take hundreds of tiny steps toward a
+         * thin contact. Keep the last separating halfspace in this uncertain
+         * case rather than silently allowing a grazing crossing. Re-evaluate
